Hivra mirror
============

The local half of HumanLayer's Claude Code plugin (mod, protocol, mapper,
parent-pid discovery, the session-variable skip, and transcript backfill).

Source: https://github.com/humanlayer/humanlayer
License: Apache-2.0
Copyright: The upstream files were not in the checkout; Apache-2.0

The HumanLayer checkout was not in the sources tree, and this adaptation had
no network, so that local half is reimplemented from the behaviour WP-85
describes rather than copied byte for byte. HumanLayer's cloud transport
(login, personal access token, session-sdk-auth) is not included. This plugin
talks only to Hivra's loopback port on this Mac.
